OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen leaves 2,000 homes
OL,4,Awithout power as wind and rain batters
OL,5,AWales
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of homes have been left
OL,8,Fwithout power as Storm Austen hits
OL,9,FWales.
OL,11,FThe biggest outage is in Cardigan,
OL,12,Fwhere more than 500 homes have been
OL,13,Faffected, National Grid has reported.
OL,15,FThe Met Office had warned Austen, the
OL,16,Ffirst named storm of the autumn, would
OL,17,Fbring strong winds up to 70mph
OL,18,F(112km/h) overnight on Thursday and
OL,19,Finto Friday, mainly in coastal areas.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
