OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen leaves 2,000 homes
OL,4,Awithout power as wind and rain batters
OL,5,AWales
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo yellow warnings for Wales are in
OL,8,Fplace on Friday, with periods of heavy
OL,9,Frain expected. The Met Office said
OL,10,Finjuries and danger to life from flying
OL,11,Fdebris were possible and advised
OL,12,Fdrivers and those using public
OL,13,Ftransport to plan ahead.
